# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this the context is 1.0 GB, and both Dockerfiles would be actively broken by
# it: they `COPY packages ./packages` and `COPY apps/<name> ./apps/<name>` after
# installing dependencies inside the image, so a host `node_modules` in the context
# lands on top of the Linux install with macOS binaries.

# 729 MB, and platform-specific. Dependencies are installed inside the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output. Regenerated in the image; .next alone is 247 MB.
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Prisma client. `prisma generate` runs in the image for its own platform.
node_modules/.prisma
**/generated

# Never ship credentials into an image layer. Runtime configuration comes from
# env_file / secrets, and .env.example stays as the documented template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.gitignore

# Promo videos and stills, ~57 MB, none of it referenced by the app. Only
# logo-transparent.png and banner-stunks.png are imported.
Asset/Promo

# Local-only working directories.
semantic-review
coverage
*.log

# Docs and editor state do not change the build.
docs
*.md
!README.md
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
